                            <div class="review">
                                My name is Vitoka H Sema from Nalan University. I came to The IoT Academy for a 4-week
                                winter training on IT and Embedded Systems. I did many projects and the teaching was
                                very practical. It was my first experience of this kind of training, and I learned a
                                lot. I am very thankful to all the faculty at IoT Academy.
