                            <div class="review">
                                My name is Sohail Hamza from Kashmir. I searched on Google for the best IoT institute
                                for hardware training and found The IoT Academy. Here, I worked on major IoT projects.
                                The teaching is more practical than theoretical, which most other institutes do not
                                offer. I got real hands-on experience here. Thank you, The IoT Academy.
                            </div>

