                            <div class="review">
                                I am Atif Ahmed from Srinagar, J&K. I came to The IoT Academy for winter training in
                                electronics hardware. We checked many institutes, but this was the best. The faculty is
                                very helpful and calm. We did projects like Traffic Monitoring, Ultrasonic Distance
                                Sensing, and worked with Node MCU. I recommend everyone to come here.
                            </div>

