                            <div class="review">
                                I am Adnan from IUST. I joined the 4-week Embedded Systems and IoT course at IoT
                                Academy. We started with basics, then learned C Programming, and did Arduino projects
                                like a Traffic Light System, Ultrasonics, and LDR. After that, we moved to IoT and did
                                projects like Weather Monitoring. I recommend The IoT Academy to everyone.
                            </div>

