                            <div class="review">
                                I am from Kashmir and came to The IoT Academy for winter training. It was a brilliant
                                experience for my friends and me. We worked on many new projects under our mentor
                                Devana, who helped us a lot. The faculty is very cooperative. We learned about ESP
                                boards and many other new technologies. Thank you, IoT Academy.
                            </div>

