                            <div class="review">
                                My name is Vaibhav Raj Singh from MIT Scholar. I did a 2-month internship at The IoT
                                Academy. I learned about STM32, SDR, Bison Board, and communication protocols. I worked
                                on real projects and gained good practical experience. It was a great experience that
                                improved my technical skills.
                            </div>

