                            <div class="review">
                                I am Anand Kumar from Nalan University. I joined the 4-week Embedded Systems and IoT
                                course at The IoT Academy. The learning was very practical. We did projects like Smart
                                Street Light and Object Avoidance using Ultrasonic and LDR sensors. The teaching style
                                makes it easy to learn. I suggest everyone join this course. Thank you.
                            </div>

