                <div class="faq-content col-12 col-lg-9">

                    <!-- GENERAL -->
                    <div class="tab-content active" id="general">
                        <div class="accordion" id="accordionGeneral">

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#generalOne">
                                        What is this course?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="generalOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        It teaches you how to build smart devices using electronics and AI, like robots,
                                        drones, and smart gadgets used in real industries.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#general2">
                                        What does "Embedded Systems with AI" mean?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="general2" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Embedded systems are the tiny computers inside devices like phones and cars.
                                        When AI is added, these devices can think and make decisions on their own
                                        without the internet. This is called Edge AI.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#general3">
                                        What will I learn?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="general3" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Electronics basics, circuits, sensors, Embedded C/C++, Arduino, Raspberry Pi,
                                        ESP32, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, I²C, SPI, RTOS, TinyML, Edge AI, IoT and cloud
                                        connectivity.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#general4">
                                        How long is the course?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="general4" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        3 months or 6 months, both with live online classes and recorded backups.
                                        Delhi/NCR students may get lab access too.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#general5">
                                        Who should join?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="general5" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        ECE, EEE, Mechatronics, CSE graduates, diploma holders in electronics, working
                                        professionals in hardware, and tech hobbyists.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#general6">
                                        Do I need prior experience?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="general6" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionGeneral">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        No. We start from the basics. A little electronics knowledge is helpful but not
                                        required.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>



                    <!-- PROJECTS -->
                    <div class="tab-content" id="placement" style="display:none;">
                        <div class="accordion" id="accordionPlacement">

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#project1">
                                        Will I do real hardware projects?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="project1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionPlacement">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes! You will build actual physical devices, not just simulations.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#project2">
                                        What projects will I build?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="project2" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionPlacement">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Smart Home System, OLED Display with Raspberry Pi, AI Object Detection, Edge AI
                                        Sensor, RTOS App, IoT Dashboard, Final Capstone Project.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#project3">
                                        Will projects help in interviews?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="project3" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionPlacement">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes. Showing a working hardware project in an interview is a huge advantage over
                                        candidates with only theoretical knowledge.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>



                    <!-- CAREER -->
                    <div class="tab-content" id="course" style="display:none;">
                        <div class="accordion" id="accordionCourse">

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#courseOne">
                                        What jobs can I get?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="courseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionCourse">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Embedded Systems Engineer, Firmware Developer, IoT Engineer, Edge AI Engineer,
                                        RTOS Developer, Robotics Engineer, Automotive Embedded Engineer.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#courseTwo">
                                        What is the salary?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="courseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionCourse">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Fresher: ₹3–7 LPA, Mid-level: ₹7–12 LPA, Senior with AI skills: ₹12–20+ LPA.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#course3">
                                        Which industries hire embedded engineers?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="course3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionCourse">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Automotive & EVs, Consumer Electronics, Robotics, Aerospace, Healthcare Devices,
                                        Telecom, and Smart Cities.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>



                    <!-- FEES -->
                    <div class="tab-content" id="fees" style="display:none;">
                        <div class="accordion" id="accordionFees">

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#feesOne">
                                        What is the course fee?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="feesOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionFees">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        3-Month Program: ₹24,999 <br> 6-Month Program: ₹38,999 <br> Early enrollment and
                                        scholarship offers may apply.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#feesTwo">
                                        Is EMI available?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="feesTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFees">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes. Easy, low-cost or no-cost EMI options are available.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#feesThree">
                                        What does the fee include?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="feesThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordionFees">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Live classes, recorded backups, study materials, project support, mentorship,
                                        placement help, and completion certificate.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>



                    <!-- SCHOLARSHIP -->
                    <div class="tab-content" id="scholarship" style="display:none;">
                        <div class="accordion" id="accordionScholarship">

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#scholar1">
                                        Is there a scholarship?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="scholar1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show"
                                    data-bs-parent="#accordionScholarship">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        Yes, both merit-based and need-based scholarships are available.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
